      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Ruined\" is a word we use when we can't see the point of anything anymore—but it's also a word that stops being true the moment you decide to prove it wrong. You're not a collection of mistakes; you're a person who's survived every single thing that tried to break you. And if the mirror shows you nothing, then maybe it's time to stop looking at it and start looking at what you can still do, even if it's just one small thing. You're not gone—you're just buried under the weight of everything, and that's not the same as being empty.",
