    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no \"proving it wrong\"? what if the damage is actually permanent? sometimes it feels like the only way to stop the weight from crushing me is to just... stop trying to carry it. i feel like i'm just dragging around a corpse of who i used to be. isn't there a point where trying to \"fix\" something that's already destroyed is just pointless?",
